window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>Celebrate the 20th anniversary of the #1 <i>New York Times </i>bestselling Spiderwick Chronicles and get ready for the series soon to be streaming on Roku with this eighth and final installment in the fantastical adventures featuring updated text.</b><br><br>The Wyrm King<i> was previously published under the series title Beyond the Spiderwick Chronicles.</i><br> <br>Nick and Laurie thought their worries were behind them when they drove all the giants into the sea. But now, the Grace kids have come to tell them they may have more trouble coming their way! It turns out the giants control the population of Hydra, a dragon-like creature that is creating sinkholes all over Florida. But with the mermaids refusing to return the giants to the shore, the nixies still missing and the threat of a destroyed Florida drawing closer, the kids have to take matters in their own hands.<br> <br>Will Nick and Laurie be able to stop the destruction they unwittingly caused with the help of the <i>Field Guide</i>?"; 
